oset, a voice—smooth, synthetic, and utterly serene—whispered, *\"Welcome to Sector 9, Player. Your trial phase has begun.\"* The door creaked open on its own, revealing a hallway that stretched infinitely into the distance, bathed in an eerie, blue-tinted glow.", "logprobs": [{"token": "E", "logprob": -2.0201058387756348}, {"token": "than", "logprob": -0.011413282714784145}, {"token": " j", "logprob": -0.33640623092651367}, {"token": "olt", "logprob": -0.0008743754005990922}, {"token": "ed", "logprob": -1.4066597032069694e-05}, {"token": " awake", "logprob": -0.008780560456216335}, {"token": " to", "logprob": -0.22976307570934296}, {"token": " the", "logprob": -0.06538958847522736}, {"token": " bl", "logprob": -1.3849073648452759}, {"token": "inding", "logprob": -0.20070073008537292}, {"token": " flick", "logprob": -3.906808853149414}, {"token": "er", "logprob": -0.0007111880695447326}, {"token": " of", "logprob": -9.226373367710039e-05}, {"token": " white", "logprob": -3.3254475593566895}, {"token": " noise", "logprob": -1.2983137369155884}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -0.32347822189331055}, {"token": " his", "logprob": -0.07463987916707993}, {"token": " heart", "logprob": -3.285353422164917}, {"token": " hammer", "logprob": -0.5416936278343201}, {"token": "ing", "logprob": -0.0006201728247106075}, {"token": " against", "logprob": -0.4775393605232239}, {"token": " his", "logprob": -0.0010661162668839097}, {"token": " ribs", "logprob": -0.03880072012543678}, {"token": " as", "logprob": -1.1420564651489258}, {"token": " he", "logprob": -0.24977503716945648}, {"token": " lifted", "logprob": -5.493922233581543}, {"token": " a", "logprob": -0.6647642254829407}, {"token": " trembling", "logprob": -0.9594770669937134}, {"token": " hand", "logprob": -0.002893430180847645}, {"token": " to", "logprob": -0.14206229150295258}, {"token": " his", "logprob": -0.6440463662147522}, {"token": " face", "logprob": -0.08289671689271927}, {"token": ".", "logprob": -0.6474135518074036}, {